## Data


- **Model:** one fact table (2,595,732 rows) connected to Date, Product, and Household dimension tables through many-to-one relationships
- **Cleaning steps:** [e.g. created a date table, built a YearMonth column, set up relationships]
- **Limitations:**
  - The household table covers 800 of the 2,500 households, so about 44% of sales have no income category and show as blank in the income slicer.
  - The data ramps up in early 2017 and ends on December 12, 2018, so the first and last months are incomplete and year-over-year growth shouldn't be read from them.

## How to Open the Dashboard

1. Download `sales_dashboard.pbix` from this repository.
2. Open it with [Power BI Desktop](https://powerbi.microsoft.com/desktop/) (free, Windows only).

